== Trivia ==
*Fairies can have different names, including Akia, Tyene, Yve, Ilene or Steve.
*When [[The Catacombs]] first released, the mechanics behind the Special Score calculation were unclear. This led to a popular misconception that killing '''Fairies''' reduced it, but this has since been proven to be false.
*Two Fairies will spawn in the stands during the [[Thorn]]  boss fight.
*Contrary to what {{NPCSprite|Tia the Fairy}} and the {{NPCSprite|Fairylosopher}}s say, they don't spawn a fairy soul upon death.

